  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1271769,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Relive the golden age of arcade and console gaming with this incredible compilation of twelve classic titles! *LaunchBox* delivers a diverse and thrilling collection for your Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, offering hours of nostalgic fun.\n\nPrepare for an action-packed adventure with *Dragon Ball Z*, battling iconic foes and mastering powerful techniques. Test your reflexes in *Space Invaders*, dodging relentless waves of alien ships. Experience the strategic depth of *Columns*, building towering blocks to outsmart your opponents. \n\nFrom the frantic fun of *Bomber Man* to the challenging puzzles of *Volfide*, each game provides a unique and captivating experience.  *Shangai* tests your pattern recognition skills, while *Flicky* requires gentle guidance to rescue adorable birds.  *7 Dragon Ball* offers a different spin on the popular franchise.  *Bomber King* brings a new twist to the classic formula. *Dragons Eye* challenges your aim and precision.  *Star Wars* lets you relive the epic space battles. Finally, *Volley Fire* provides fast-paced arcade sports action.  *LaunchBox* is the ultimate retro gaming experience!"
    },
